WEBVTT

00:00:00.351 --> 00:00:15.511
In this example, Antigravity was saved as the worker default before onboarding. All three harnesses are ready. This time the owner wants a single connection. Clear the boxes for Antigravity and Claude Code, leave Codex checked, and create the first project.

00:00:16.668 --> 00:00:28.748
The project opens with only Codex usage in the bar. Open Harnesses to see the sole connection and its reported limits. Under Agents and models, Codex is the only choice and the default for new tasks.
